<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is entombed in a warcasket. No amount of pain will have an effect on {PAWN_objective}, and {PAWN_pronoun} can never go into a pain shock or drop unconscious due to pain. Because of how bulky the armor is and how much energy it takes to use it, {PAWN_nameDef} is not capable of most work, but can still do research, smithing and hacking. -->
  <OLWC_WarcasketTrait_Overlord.degreeDatas.warcasket.description>{PAWN_nameDef}被封在了战棺里。再剧烈的疼痛也影响不了{PAWN_objective}，{PAWN_pronoun}永远不会因疼痛而休克或昏迷。由于装甲十分笨重，使用起来又极其耗能，{PAWN_nameDef}无法从事大多数工作，但仍然可以从事研究、锻造和骇入。</OLWC_WarcasketTrait_Overlord.degreeDatas.warcasket.description>
  <!-- EN: warcasket -->
  <OLWC_WarcasketTrait_Overlord.degreeDatas.warcasket.label>战棺</OLWC_WarcasketTrait_Overlord.degreeDatas.warcasket.label>

</LanguageData>
